Package: com.m3ga.m3gagravity
Name: M3gaGravity
Version: 0.2.15
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Home Screen icon physics for jailbroken iOS 6.
 Hold an app icon briefly, then move your finger to pick it up and interact with it.
 Drag icons around the page and release to fling them; enable gravity for falling,
 collisions, and piles. Gravity is OFF by default. Includes Instructions and creator information.
Maintainer: M3gaIOS6p0w3r
Author: M3gaIOS6p0w3r
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 6.0)
